# Titan 2 Elite, Uyghur layout: base letters, the Shift layer including the two-letter لا, a tapped
# Shift consumed once by لا, and the Alt punctuation that replaces the device symbols on N, V and J.
# Uyghur has no letter case: neither the empty note nor ". " selects the Shift layer automatically.
# Requires auto-capitalization of the first letter and after a period enabled (the defaults).
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout uyghur
hw press D
hw press B
hw type ". "
hw press D
expect "دب. د"
hw hold SHIFT_RIGHT
hw press M
hw press J
hw press L
hw release SHIFT_RIGHT
hw press L
expect "دب. دئجلال"
hw press SHIFT_RIGHT
hw press L
hw press L
expect "دب. دئجلاللال"
hw hold ALT_LEFT
hw press N
hw press V
hw press J
hw release ALT_LEFT
expect "دب. دئجلاللال،؟؛"
